      "rationale": "Directly provides the 'issue theme' axis the query requires for grouping resolution time. Categorizations are well-grounded in source text (billing, SSO/auth, performance outage, feature request). Minor imprecision: CS-0003 labeled 'performance' when it is more an outage, but still a defensible reading."
